window.products.push({"id":894031,"name":"Scratch Off Map of The World, with Country Flags and US State Borders - Laminated Surface - Scrape Tool Included - Bright and Vibrant Colors - Designe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1t0Z9TUIUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you searching for a way to keep your travel memories last forever? Have you ever thought about mapping the places you have visited? Dotty N’Spotty World Traveler Scratch off Map will make your memories unforgettable. This map was designed by travelers for travelers. Detailed Design This map’s deep blue background portrays the oceans, and the continents whose country colors are very vibrant and easy to see. The map includes labels for countries, capitals, oceans, seas; bigger rivers and lakes are also mapped in. The gold layer shows the topographical relief of our planet, which makes the map interesting to look at even if the majority of it is still uncovered. Educational Value The map encourages modern approaches to teach children to play with the map and discover the names of the countries they are revealing by scratching off. You and your kids can play searching games of world oceans, seas, small islands etc.The map is not so small that the details are lost, and not so big that it would be impractical to display on a wall. With the dimensions of 34 x 17.5 inches, it can be easily put into a frame (recommended size 35 x 18).Do you already own it? Dotty N’Spotty World Traveler Scratch off Map can be a perfect gift for your family and friends. About Us Dotty N’Spotty is backed by two enthusiastic world travelers. After years of traveling and discovering the world, we started to track our adventures and realized that we wanted to keep our memories and future plans close to us. That’s what inspired the Dotty N’ Spotty World Traveler Scratch off Map. Are you unhappy with your purchase? We offer you a 100% money back guarantee within 30 days of purchase.Do not miss this awesome opportunity and order your own Dotty N’Spotty World Traveler Scratch off Map .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1t0Z9TUIUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dotty N'Spotty","source_asin":"B07577JXXY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-894031","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07577JXXY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07577JXXY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
