window.products.push({"id":894100,"name":"Chef's Star Stainless Steel Electric Milk Frother - Automatic Foam Maker & Creamer Steamer - Warmer & Heater, Best For Coffee, Cappuccino, Latte, Espr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QSquIrKPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Looking for a luscious latte? How about a creamy cappuccino? Want a gourmet coffee experience without spending an arm and a leg? Our electric milk frother quickly creates rich, creamy, and long-lasting froth at the push of a button. Just pour milk up to the appropriate capacity, press start and in just 80 seconds you will have luscious creamy froth.  Each unit comes equipped with two small whisks – one for frothing milk and the other for just heating. The default configuration out of the box is heating. The frothing whisk is stored in the machine, which will froth cold or hot milk.  The heavy-duty motor makes thick and creamy froth from whole milk. It will even froth low-fat and non-dairy milks such as almond or soy milk. Our milk frother heats about 1 cup (8 oz / 250 ml) of milk at a time. ***NOTE: For frothing, use half that amount (4 oz / 125 ml) due to the milk doubling in volume as it foams. Level indicators will show you when you have it correct.*** Features: Automatically froths 125ml of milk | Heats 250ml of milk From cold to hot milk in about 80 seconds Convenient detachable base for easy pouring Vacuum insulation helps contents maintain temperature ***NEW FROTH DENSITY FUNCTION: Choose from Hot Airy Foam, Hot Dense Foam, Hot Milk, or Cold Milk Frothing*** Automatic switch-off function Non-stick coating interior ensures easy cleaning Stylish design suited for any decor Perfect For Lattes, Cappuccinos, Chai, Hot Chocolate, and much more! Specifications: Material: Stainless Steel Frothing Capacity: 4.25 oz / 125 ml Heating Capacity: 8.5 oz / 250 mlWorks with 110V Limited 2 Year Warranty: We guarantee that you'll be satisfied with our frother's performance, functionality and durability! Now go an enjoy a professional cup of coffee on us!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QSquIrKPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chef's Star","source_asin":"B072W1MWDG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-894100","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072W1MWDG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072W1MWDG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
