window.products.push({"id":894240,"name":"guyf Glass Measuring Cup 4 Markings (CUP, ML, TBSP, OZ ) Microwave, Freezer, Oven Safe Heat-Resistant Borosilicate Cups for Milk Coffee Drinking (2Cup","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616OLNQGi7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Capacity: 1000ML ，4Cup，32OZ，64TBSP Product net weight: 391g Product gross weight: 445 g Material: Borosilicate Glass Products include 1000ML measuring glass cup ×1 Product size: 16.5x9.8cm Packing size: 16.5x9.8cm 1:Slender, beaker-styled design. the overall build quality is good High-strength measuring glass, lightweight and good stability, easy to use. The nontypical measuring cup.A beaker with a handle.Easy to Grip: The large and medium cups equip with handles that make it easy to grip the measuring cups and pour water. 2:Comfortable handle. A smooth and comfortable surface makes it easy to hold. A good and nicely designed quality measuring cup. The borosilicate glass is thin and lightweight, easy on your hand. 3:High borosilicate measuring glass. The glass cup is made of high borosilicate material and can be heated and refrigerated. It is a very lightweight jug, the glass is thin and High-strength. 4:V-Shaped spout. V-Shaped spout, Spare you drips and dribbles, easy to clean. Each comes with easy-to-read measurement marks, so you can see them at a glance. 5:Bright and legible measurement markings 4 style measuring markings. Precise Measurements: Perfect for measuring liquids, dry ingredients, rice, pet food, etc. 6:This four-cup measurer can take heat or cold and you can use it a lot in the microwave to heat. 7:High-quality Material: The glass measuring cups are made of high-quality borosilicate glass, which is lighter and more heat resistant than ordinary glass cups. It’s able to put them in the fridge and microwave, oven, or even put them in the dishwasher to clean it. 8:The item is a glass product, which may be damaged during transportation. If the product you received is defective, you can contact us, we will arrange a full refund for you or send you a new item.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616OLNQGi7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"guyf","source_asin":"B09KTY6BB8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-894240","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KTY6BB8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KTY6BB8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":894241,"name":"Ceramic Tea Bowl Cup Chawan Porcelain Teacup Shallow Summer Chinese Teaware (amber, crimson)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zKkL+P1GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The inner surface of this lovely tea bowl features crimson glazing while from outside it is covered with contrasting glaze. The shallow cup with wide mouth is a perfect choice for summer tea drinking as it allows the beverage to cool rapidly. The vessel is designed to fit snugly into the palm of the hand. At the same time its well-balanced shape and a steady foot let you safely put the teacup on the table. The tea bowl was manufactured in Henan province famous for its ancient traditions of pottery. Tea is a wonderful beverage which is enjoyed all through the world and there are a lot of ceremonies in all parts of Asia for drinking and preparing the tea. This lovely tradition came to us from China where the tea was first used as a medicine. According to the legend, one of the ruler in the ancient China was looking for medical cures and got poisoned. And a drop of water from the tea tree saved him. So it is only prudent and just that Asian and especially Chinese ceramics and porcelain teaware is considered to be the first choice when it comes to taking a break from the mundane to drink a cup of Oolong or Rooibos. Or a couple. “Pacific tea” is based in Hong Kong and strictly follows old traditions of tea culture. Our company has been wholesaling tea and teaware for about 130 years all over the world. Among our customers there are Chinese communities and restaurants, tea clubs and embassies. We are proud of the tea tradition in China, and we are dreaming of showing people the difference between ordinary tea drinking and savouring each drop of the precious liquor in the best Asian style.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zKkL+P1GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pacific Tea","source_asin":"B01M9I2Q05","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-894241","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M9I2Q05","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M9I2Q05","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
