window.products.push({"id":894267,"name":"Set of 2 Pillow Cases 600 Thread Count 100% Egyptian Cotton Long Staple Pillowcase, Durable and Silky Soft Pillow Covers, Natural Luxurious Hotel Clas","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tzsbUnfDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HIGHEST QUALITY BEST EGYPTIAN COTTON PILLOW CASES: Made from 100% Long Staple Egyptian Cotton, these pillowcases will remain fresh & retain softness for a long period of time, are fade resistant in nature & safe for the environment too. The breathable fabric made of Egyptian cotton offers you an ultimate solution for every season. KING PILLOWCASE SET: This package includes a set of 2 Pieces: 21\" x 40\" finished size to fit king size pillows which are 20\" x 36\". The pure cotton yarns give the fabric a silky, soft & smooth finishing. There are multiple colours to choose from to suit your décor & style. The pillow cases are durable & easy to maintain. FLAWLESS PROCESS: Experience the feel of hotel linens with the perfection of our exquisitely crafted 600 TC pillowcases, all at an incredible price. The 100% Long Staple Egyptian Pure Cotton used to make our pillowcases is well-known for its superior quality and durability, and we use only safe and organic dyes. Our pillowcases are carefully crafted using sustainable methods, in a top-class facility. EASY TO CARE & MAINTAIN: These pillowcases are easy to care for & maintain. Simply wash them regularly in a tumble dry cycle to keep them fresh & clean. These pillowcases tend to become soft after every wash & will maintain a smooth finish that will only improve over time. A GREAT GIFTING ITEM: Planning to gift something durable yet stylish to your family & friends? Look no further. These pillowcases are great gifting for every occasion. It could be Birthdays, Anniversaries, Christmas, Halloween, Housewarming, and many more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tzsbUnfDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kotton Wama Bedding","source_asin":"B0BH1LZ8GP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-894267","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BH1LZ8GP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BH1LZ8GP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":894268,"name":"K-Musculo Emerald Isle Ceramic Mug Collection with Ireland Shamrock Design","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qQOQAErML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The ancient Celts are famous for their carvings, art and design. Much of modern art owes itself to the creativity and artistic nature of these people. The Book of Kells is possibly the finest example of ancient Celtic Art in existence. This item encompasses the interlacing knotwork famously associated with Celtic art, now created and crafted as a decorative mug for the home. The word 'Ireland' is printed in the middle of the mug, with 'Cead Mile Failte' on the inside rim. Please do not hesitate to contact us for any further information.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qQOQAErML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Clara Crafts","source_asin":"B00K1JKNJ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-894268","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00K1JKNJ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00K1JKNJ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
