window.products.push({"id":894365,"name":"Glamour Magazine June/July 2018 | Anne Hathaway – Solidarity Issue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MBx6ohKBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"New; see scans and description. New York: Condé Nast, 2018. The June-July, 2018 issue of Glamour Magazine. Anne Hathaway cover, and article. Solidarity Issue. Quarto, photo-illustrated perfect-bound wraps, 134 pp. New, and with no rack wear. The long-lived (founded 1939) women's genre magazine - no longer the thick, large-format, richly-produced collectible of the 1990s and earlier, due to, presumably, financial constraints - still bears the same soul, here in 134 pages of fashion, makeup, style, sex, health, relationship, and celebrity journalism, with very professional photography to match make even the contents pages (which see) an engaging read. Some of the stuff: Anne Hathaway; Next Activism; Summer Skin Fixes; Vacation Fashion; Retro Wardrobe; Rebellious Style; Power Dressing; Lipstick; Cynthia Nixon; Alabama Rising. And, as always, splashy stunner model ad shots, though fewer of them now than in the 90s) by top photographers. Ships in a sturdy, new, protective box - not a bag. LPR41","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MBx6ohKBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B07DD1F7V5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-894365","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DD1F7V5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DD1F7V5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
