window.products.push({"id":894375,"name":"Cen-Tec Systems 96964 Central Vacuum Electric Brush Package with 35 Ft. Direct Connect Hose, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":375.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81I4oQG9aeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Consumers are showing a strong preference for the new high density soft carpets which pose a unique problem for many high performance vacuums and power nozzles. Not only have the high density soft carpets been difficult to clean, the consumer has often found they can’t push the vacuum across the surface. The CT25 power nozzle, which combines features typical of premium power nozzles with a unique self-regulating air by pass system which automatically adjusts air flow to floor conditions permitting a true deep clean in a system designed to move freely over even the highest density soft carpets. Power nozzles on traditional carpets permit the air to flow under the agitator, traveling up and back carrying the dirt into the air stream. The new high density soft carpets prevent the air to enter through this traditional means. The challenge was to develop a solution which adjusts to meet carpet conditions while still keeping the air stream entering under the agitator for an effective clean. Other systems vent, but much of the air is wasted traveling over the agitator not under where it is most effective in carrying away dirt. Should the nozzle begin to seal to the carpet, the CT25 allows a self adjusting air relief entering through vents in the hood of the nozzle. This channels air uniformly down and across the front face of the nozzle and delivers the air under the agitator as with traditional power nozzles. The result is no wasted air flow, effective cleaning, and a self regulating system that works as well on traditional carpets as it does on the new high density ultra soft carpets. This is a complete package which also includes a 35 ft. direct connect hose and complete set of accessories.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81I4oQG9aeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cen-Tec Systems","source_asin":"B09V26PZRX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-894375","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09V26PZRX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09V26PZRX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
