window.products.push({"id":894434,"name":"Lengthened Oversized Blanket Hoodie Wearable Blanket Sweatshirt for Women Men Kids - Black Hoodie Blanket Hooded Blanket with Sleeves and Giant Pocket","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61X8PeUNmGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Super Soft Flannel LENGHTHENED BLANKET HOODIE - This is a true one-size-fits-all blanket hoodie. It's super thick & warm & soft & long. Better than others, we extended the length of the blanket sweatshirt to 4’. Because it is longer, you can curl up in your recliner and cover most of your body with the wearable blanket. This truly improved 5XL hoodie blanket is suitable for the adult who is generally 5'5''-6'4'' tall for maximum comfort. SUPER SOFT & COMFORTABLE MATERIAL - Our luxuriously soft wearable blanket is made with 370 high GSM fluffy and thick flannel on both sides. It is thick, plush and warm and it feels truly amazing on. Soft and velvety outside, soft and fluffy inside. You could wear it all the time, the only problem is that you wouldn't want to pull it off! 2022 UPGRADE VERSION - 2022 upgraded version is made of 100% recycled material certified by the Global Recycled Standard (GRS), which means that our hooded blankets are environmentally friendly and non-toxic from the original materials and the earliest stages of production. PERFECT FOR ALL OCCASIONS - This blanket hoodie is wearable and perfect to slip on immediately on arising to move around in a cold house. It is very soft and the big hoodie keeps your head warm as well. It also can fit your switch and snacks in the large pocket. Everyone will like to nest in this warm blanket for whether indoor activities or outdoor sports events. Especially camping parties and garden walks, it's like wearing a hug. YOUR BEST GIFT - Our hoodie blanket would be an awesome gift for everyone who is always cold even when it's warm out. This hooded blanket is a must have for anyone who wants to be super comfortable! It is the perfect gift for birthday, Mother’s Day and Father’s Day!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61X8PeUNmGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Barfelty","source_asin":"B092LNK96L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-894434","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092LNK96L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092LNK96L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":894435,"name":"D DrNeeko Parrot Shape Waiters Corkscrew Wine Opener Bottle Opener (Green)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.2,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KbD9VQdXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This parrot shape corkscrew opener is perfect for any occasion. With its sleek, elegant stainless steel finish, this wine opener will be a welcome addition to any home decor. This is a great gift for those who enjoy wine. How to Use your this Parrot Shape Waiters Corkscrew Wine Opener: Open the cutter which is located at the crest head of the parrot corkscrew and glide it along the foil at the top of the wine bottle.  Once the foil is removed, ensure you screw the Corkscrew into the cork and slowly pull the cork out.  Pour the required amount of wine and use the wine stopper instead of the cork to seal the bottle, until the wine is finished.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KbD9VQdXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"D DrNeeko","source_asin":"B082Z3Q42C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-894435","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082Z3Q42C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082Z3Q42C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":894436,"name":"Snowstar (Snowflake) Rotary Candleholder","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51hjJWeYs7S._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"When the included tea light candle is lit in the base of the rotary candle holder, the heat of the candle will make the snowstars and the carousel spin, and shaped reflections move around the ceiling. Comes nicely presented in a box ideal as a gift. Remarkably sophisticated with just a touch of whimsy, this snowstar candle holder is a wonderful way to bring smiles with a unique display of entertainment in motion! Each of our stunning rotary candle holders is crafted from durable metal with a beautiful silver finish. Just position the flickering tea light candle (included), and within moments the heat from the flame will set the art in motion. You can add your own scented tea light and indulge in your favorite aroma. These Änglaspel are designed in and imported from Sweden. They are contemporary versions of the traditional candle chimes. Because these were designed to actually rotate and cast beautiful shadows, the metal is thin, and the item light-weight. Some of the competing rotary candleholders you will see have less detail (especially in shadow), and 4 clappers rather than 6. When you see the Pluto Produkter AB as the manufacturer and PlutoGifts as the merchant, you can be confident of high quality and wonderful attention to detail. In order to see the hundred different choices from Pluto Produkter AB just type \"rotary candleholder\" in the search box above. For those of us who grew up with them, rotary candleholders are a seasonal blend of light and motion. They belong to a purely domestic and old-fashioned type of joy, one that emphasizes a dark room over a brightly lit one (to appreciate the dancing interplay of light and shadow); and calm over activity (so that stray air currents shouldn’t disrupt the workings). Darkness, stillness, silence: all inescapable aspects of the northern winter, and it is therefore not surprising that candleholders should be such an enduring tradition.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51hjJWeYs7S._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pluto Produkter","source_asin":"B00OEZNKZY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-894436","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00OEZNKZY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00OEZNKZY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":894437,"name":"Comfort Products Large Modern Desk with Attached Bookshelf, Espresso","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41G8+rkpUyL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Comfort Products 50-512 Large Modern Desk with Attached Bookshelf combines a contemporary styled desk with added storage space. The easy-to-assemble desk features a modern design constructed of engineered wood with wood grain paper laminate. Designed for flexibility, comfort and space, the desk can be placed next to a wall or stand alone in the center of a room, with full access to storage. The 29\" height and 22\" width will fit most office chairs comfortably under the desk. The bookshelf with 8 open compartments can also be used to display crafts, pictures, or collectables. This assembly-required desk is packaged individually.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41G8+rkpUyL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OneSpace","source_asin":"B00ZUJ1M4E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-894437","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ZUJ1M4E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ZUJ1M4E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
