window.products.push({"id":894443,"name":"TURNMEON 5 Ft Tinsel St. Patrick's Day Christmas Tree with Timer Ball Ornaments 50 Color Light 3D Star, Pop up Christmas Tree Battery Operated Sequin ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":56.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71R8eSkmTaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[ Large 3D Star & 10 Xmas Balls Ornaments ] Standing at 5ft high and 14 inch wide. This Christmas tree comes with 7.8 inch large 3D star(it needs DIY), 2 styles of 10 Christmas balls(5x matte red, 5x matte silver). Combined with dual colored tinsels and large sequins, making it look festival, sparkling and shiny. [ DIY 50 LED Lights & Battery Powered ] This Christmas tree comes with an individually 16.4Ft 50 LED string lights for DIY installation. 3 AA battery operated (battery is not included), with steady on lighting mode and colorful lights(red, yellow, blue and green). Easy to move and set. [ Timer ] It's easy to operate with a On/Off/Timer Switch on the battery box. With timer on, it will light up for 6 hours and off automatically for 18 hours cycle everyday. It will cycle every day until you turn off the timer function. [ Pop Up Xmas Tree ] The pop up Christmas tree are made of PVC and metal bracket material with four-legged base stand that is stable and sturdy. Features a pull-up design, just takes a few minutes to install and detach, convenient to store and reused for next holiday. [ Christmas Decorations ] This collapsible Christmas tree decoration can be used on the living room, corridor, bedroom, Christmas party, office, windowsill, mantel, fireplace, supermarket, shopping mall, entrance, doorway,etc.It also can be used as a gift for family and friends.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71R8eSkmTaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TURNMEON","source_asin":"B0BF11R3FW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-894443","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BF11R3FW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BF11R3FW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":894444,"name":"While we have the gift of life, it seems to me... - Gilda Radner - quotes fridge magnet, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EP6rHw5mL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"While we have the gift of life, it seems to me the only tragedy is to allow part of us to die - whether it is our spirit, our creativity or our glorious uniqueness. - Gilda Radner Quotations from famous celebrities, politicians, authors, athletes and other prominent people. Find inspirational and motivational through this quote on a beautiful fridge magnet. You can choose between two different variation (BLACK - white letters on black background) or (WHITE - black letters on white background). NOTE: This product is not waterproof, so it is not meant for outdoor use. In addition to being used on a refrigerator, it is also great decorative addition to a locker, file cabinet or any other smooth metal surface at home or work.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EP6rHw5mL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PhotoMagnets","source_asin":"B01M038KZN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-894444","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M038KZN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M038KZN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":894445,"name":"Houwsbaby 2 pcs LED Christmas Stockings Kit 3D Glowing Snowman Penguin Holders Night Light Ornament Knitted Decoration Woollen Gift Bags for Kids Part","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91SJa8W1kUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GERGEOUS DESIGN--- These Christmas stockings are knitted with woolen and some glittery silk thread which create very modern feeling. There are some LED lights are built in the Xmas stockings, when you turn on them, they will give out colorful lights. The classic red and green color scheme is sure to please, and will work with nearly any Christmas decoration theme you choose, adding the festive atmosphere to your home. GLOWING FUNCTION--- These little LED lights are powered by batteries, you need prepare 2 AA batteries in advance, they are NOT included in the package. The battery box is put in the small bag sewed in the stockings. Open the box with a screwdriver and install the batteries. There two switches you need turn, the first one is on the battery box and the second one is on the connecting wire. Don’t forget turn on or off them. AWESOME CHRISTMAS GIFTS--- The colorful flashing lights will amaze your families at your family party and they will be the best choice for Christmas gifts for kids. The night games on Christmas Eve can’t go well without these colorful LED lights, costumes, night games, the super vibrant lights in the dark will make the night brim with joy and fun. Give the guests these cute stockings and bring them a dazzling night. HIGH QUALİTY--- Made of super soft woolen with heirloom-quality craftsmanship, which can be reused for many years. Unlike other stockings, our Christmas stocking is handcraft with exquisite sewn skills and neatly knitted on both side, no loose threads running out. Highest quality materials and workmanship ensures this will last for many seasons to come! Buy with confidence, you will not got disappointed. GREAT SERVICE--- If does not use these Xmas stockings for long time, please remove the battery. Please do NOT wash it and keep away from fire. If you have any problems with the product, please don't hesitate to contact us though Amazon message. We will reply as soon as possible and we will try our best to help you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91SJa8W1kUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Houwsbaby","source_asin":"B07VBMKMJZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-894445","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VBMKMJZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VBMKMJZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
