window.products.push({"id":894476,"name":"Vintage French Bulldog Puppy - Printed on Recycled Dictionary Paper - 8\"x10.5\" - Mixed Media Dictionary Art Print/Poster on Dictionary Page","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QcnBGHtZL._AC_.jpg","description":"This adorable french bulldog puppy is printed on beautiful vintage dictionary paper. These prints are definitely a conversation starter and look fabulous as a wall hanging. Each design is carefully selected and then printed on vintage dictionary paper giving it that beautiful golden color that only comes from age. Since we use real book pages some unevenness or spotting occurs, this only adds another layer to the print, making each one truly unique. Dimensions are approximately 8\" W x 10.5\" L. *** Frames are not included.***","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QcnBGHtZL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vintage","source_asin":"B00M7PX6T8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-894476","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00M7PX6T8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00M7PX6T8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":894477,"name":"artgeist Canvas Wall Art Print Hummingbirds 80x40 in - 5pcs Home Decor Framed Stretched Picture Photo Painting Artwork Image g-C-0070-b-p","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91KCuBWvenL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CANVAS PICTURES Printed pictures are trending lately when it comes to interior designing – they serve as an alternative to classic paintings.High quality materials and large-format printers give us the opportunity to recreate even the tiniest details of the copied photography. Pictures are also UV-resistant and this is why colors are sharper than ever. Every picture is stretched over a wooden frame – you don’t need to worry about any additional utilities in order to put it on the wall. To make sure that the painting will look great on your wall, we mount the canvas onto a matched stretcher bar made of Natureeeal, solid wood (1,5 cm thick).We offer a whole variety of different themed pictures, that will give you the possibility to make your surroundings lovelier and hopefully unlock your inner creativity. The highest possible quality and modern approach will surely meet your expectations as a client.Also, keep in mind - we do not offer stocked items - every order is being produced individually after the purchase. Products are made exclusively in our own manufacturing facilities – hence, we offer the best quality vs. price ratio. IMPORTANT In case the picture consists of more than one piece, please remember to keep a certain distance between them (compare it with the picture displayed online).Please keep in mind that because of the screen settings, actual colours may vary from the ones visible on the picture online. Pictures are only displayed for illustration purposes. They serve as an exemplar of how the canvas print might look like in a particular surrounding. Please measure your wall properly and make sure you pick the right size.It's possible only to send 3 products in one package, so if you want to order more products, please submit an appropriate number of individual orders.All our products belong to the Artgeist.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91KCuBWvenL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"artgeist","source_asin":"B08C9WW4W2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-894477","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08C9WW4W2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08C9WW4W2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
