window.products.push({"id":894537,"name":"SQLHM Ice Cube Tray with Lid and Bin 72 - Ice Cube Molds for Freezer BPA Free Ice Container Comes with Scoop and Cover creative home ice maker tray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Uik82wL4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Wide range of applications: each large tray can make 72 x 1 blue, can make mini ice cubes of different flavors, 72 pieces in total (1 x ice tray 600ml). Mini ice cubes are widely used in life, perfect for making cocktails, coffee and tea, baby food, perfect for protein shakes and smoothies, a must-have for family gatherings and RV travel! Easy to handle ice cube tray: Ice cubes made of food-grade plastic are easier to take out than silicone ice cube molds, with a smooth surface and no preservatives, you can easily take it out with just a slight twist, no need to wait until the ice cubes start Melts without bottom tap or tap water. Trays can be emptied as soon as they are removed from the freezer. Simple and Convenient Ice Cube Tray: The ice cube lid and tray rim prevent water from spilling and are easier to handle than silicone ice cube trays. The uniform protrusion between each ice cube compartment allows water to flow with each other when pouring, keeping the ice cubes in perfect chunks without sticking together, easy to carry and put in the freezer without worrying about water coming out. Multi-layer Stacked Ice Trays: Ice tray lids can stack more trays, product includes: 2 x ice cube tray with lid, 1 storage container, 1 spoon. Stacked dimensions are 9.9(L) x 5.9(W) x 3.3(H) inches, perfect for RV refrigerators and home refrigerators. The lid is designed to fit the tray better, preventing the ice cubes from absorbing freezing odors, keeping the ice cubes fresh and hygienic. Also allows multiple trays to be stacked, saving a lot of space. Great for DIY creations Sturdy and Safe: Made of food-grade material, no smell, no oil film floating, safe for your family! The 72 Mini Ice Cube Tray uses better materials and design to make it stronger and more durable. Thick and bouncy! They can withstand long-term cold storage without cracking! Start using them to enjoy your iced drinks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Uik82wL4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SQLHM","source_asin":"B0C7K638NS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-894537","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C7K638NS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C7K638NS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
