window.products.push({"id":894725,"name":"Harmony Kingdom Foul Play Skunks in Log Figurine 1998 by Peter Calvesbert","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":75.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ZHwoS14IL._AC_.jpg","description":"Foul Play Artist: Peter Calvesbert Item No: TJSK Collection Name: Treasure Jest Subset Name: Small Treasure Jest Exclusive To: Harmony Kingdom Made In: England Status: Retired Carving Date: 1998 Release Date: 1/1/1999 Retirement Date: 10/26/2003 Edition Size: 16720 Price in USD: $85 Category: Box Figurine Dimensions (Inches): 2.24 x 2.52 x 2.52 Ordering Information: Available at select HK dealers or through the secondary market. S e c r e t s Three skunks guard their olFactory, armed with a canister of air freshener. Their neighbour, the rabbit, has donned his daily apparel: a gas mask. The unfortunate porcupine with his low tech defense (a clothes peg), has succumbed to the awful stench. Even the snake has failed to slither away in time. Peters mouse must be holding his breath. And why the Australian skink? Well, he thought he was going to star in a Harmony Kingdom box figurine and is appalled and embarrassed at his error. How could he confuse skink with skunk? Is Australian English so different from American English or British English? I love Plum is a reference to a military store on an island off the East Coast of the United States. Inside Edition 1 there is a young skunk reading from a recipe book and mixing ingredients for the skunk pong in a cauldron. The inscription around the cauldron refers to the official term for the skunk's smelly fluid, mercaptan. Scattered around the pot are two tins of baked beans (57 variety), salt and pepper, a bat wing, eyeballs, fish and more secret ingredients. The Infinity Version has old sneakers. Hallmarks include Â, star, HBC logo, ed.#, and Pc. Skunk","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ZHwoS14IL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Harmony Kingdom","source_asin":"B01M3VIRU9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-894725","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M3VIRU9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M3VIRU9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
