window.products.push({"id":894733,"name":"MOON MIRROR Pivot Bathroom Mirror, Black Oval Mirror for Bathroom, Oval Black Vanity Mirror, Oval Pivot Bathroom Mirror, Tilting Bathroom Pivoting Mir","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":119.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Q-HSqRhTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Stainless Steel BEAUTIFUL IN DESIGN: A slim, modern-inspired stainless steel frame hugs the simple yet impactful black oval mirror, upgraded tilting angled design allow the pivoting mirror to tilt and stay at the perfect angle based on your preference, making it ideal for a family bath. With its trending matte black finish , display it in your bathroom, entryway, living room, or bedroom as an easy way to decorate your walls while bringing light and space into the room. BUILD YOUR BATHROOM SPACE WITH PIVOT MIRROR: Consider oval pivot mirrors to soften the straight edges in surrounding elements, our 22x30’’ oval mirror is suitable for smaller narrow bathroom. You can hang this black mirror vertically with sconces beside to complete your newly constructed or remodeled bathroom. DIMENSION: Overall (Includes pivot grommets): 25.37\" x 30\"x 2.24\", mirror size: 22\" x 30\", Features in matte black, brushed gold, brushed nickel finish, choose from one of our beautiful oval pivot mirrors to best suit your style. SUPERIOR IN QUALITY: This pivot oval mirror is made of heavy duty 304 stainless steel---sturdy, durable, anti-scratch, corrosion resistant and rustproof which is ideal for bathroom. 4mm no-distortion HD floating glass to deliver clear reflection, 9mm thick TSCA certified anti-corrosion backboard to strengthen the glass for safety. Each oval bathroom mirror lends exceptional strength to resist humidity and can stay unchanged overtime. PIVOT MIRROR INSTALLATION TIPS: 1.Provided anchors and screws are not suitable for hanging on drywall. Highly recommend you to apply suggestion from a contractor or hardware store for drywall, we would return the extra cost for buying the new hardware. Or email us directly, we will ship out the free new drywall anchors separately to you ASAP. 2. Missing hardware or brackets, pls contact us for replacement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Q-HSqRhTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MOON MIRROR","source_asin":"B091SPX72D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-894733","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091SPX72D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091SPX72D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
