window.products.push({"id":894842,"name":"Royal Works Bed Bridge Twin to King Converter Kit – Includes 2 Pillow Cases and Travel Bag – Twin to King Gap Filler Converter Kit Mattress Connector ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XFqLBEs1L._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"Close the Gap Stretch-out in comfort on a larger bed with the Royal Works Bed Bridge for twin to king mattresses. This ingenious bed gap filler transforms any 2 mattresses into a smooth, spacious bed for you and your spouse or even your whole family. Made with soft, cushioning and hypoallergenic Memory Foam, our mattress connector with mattress strap unites 2 twin beds to make a king bed for house guests, or acts as a bed bridge for split king adjustable beds to make it cozier for couples. Reunite in Sleep Any 2 mattresses, even if they are different sizes and different firmness, can be joined together using the Royal Works Bed Bridge Kit. The bridge features 2 connecting loops at each end through which the mattress strap passes. This holds it securely in-place so it does not shift under fitful sleepers. The sturdy nylon mattress strap is outfitted with a strong adjustment buckle, allowing you to cinch it tightly around both mattresses for stability. The Bed Bridge Kit belongs in your cruise essentials, where it ensures a smooth and relaxing large king bed during your trip of a lifetime. Head-to-Toe Comfort Rest your weary head for the night on pillowcases included in our bed gap filler kit. Soft, breathable and made of eco-friendly, hypoallergenic knit fabric, our zippered pillow cases create a barrier to sweat, saliva and facial oils from seeping through to your skin. Pillowcases, bed bridge and strap all slip into a complimentary carry bag for easy use in hotels during travel or to store away until house guests arrive. For king-size comfort at home and on-the-go, add the Royal Works Bed Bridge Kit to your bedding accessories today.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XFqLBEs1L._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Royal Works","source_asin":"B09DXLHF81","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-894842","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DXLHF81","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DXLHF81","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
