window.products.push({"id":894909,"name":"White Bread Box For Kitchen Countertop - Bread Box With Bamboo Wood Cutting Board Lid - Farmhouse White Bread Boxes - Metal Large Bread Box Modern Sty","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hIDv5QGSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keep Your Baked Goods Fresh: This small bread box includes 6 ventilation holes to ensure long-lasting freshness for your favorite baked goods. The vents on the bread bin ensure the ideal air circulation and moisture regulation to prevent your bread from becoming stale. Organize Your Kitchen & Counter Space: The Nicola Living bread boxes are the perfect addition to your kitchen for storing your favorite bread, bagels, muffins, pastries, and snacks. It can also be used as a storage container for potatoes, onion, garlic, and other kitchen supplies. This bread box will keep your kitchen clutter-free and optimize your existing kitchen counter space. 2 in 1 Bamboo Cutting Board Lid: The bamboo wood lid serves a dual purpose as a cutting board for your bread and baked goods. This elegant and modern design is multi-functional - turn over the lid and slice your bread directly on the interior side of the lid for a convenient clean-up! The natural bamboo lid can also be used to serve appetizers, cheese, or charcuterie boards. Large Capacity & High Quality: This perfectly sized bread box container saves counter space and holds 1 large loaf of bread or 12 bagels. The bread box is constructed of restaurant-grade galvanized metal which is certified for food safety and is non-toxic. The dimensions of the bread box are 13 in x 7in x 4.8 in. The Nicola Living bread boxes are durable, built to last, and easy to wipe clean. Nicola Living Promise - At Nicola Living, we pride ourselves on designing with premium materials to ensure high-quality products for our customers. The Nicola Living promise means that if you are unhappy with the product at any time, let us know and we will send you a replacement at no charge.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hIDv5QGSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nicola Living","source_asin":"B08X1W3184","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-894909","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08X1W3184","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08X1W3184","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
