window.products.push({"id":894931,"name":"Disney Princess 100% Cotton Kitchen Towels, 2pk-Soft & Absorbent Decorative Kitchen Towels Perfect for Drying Dishes & Hands-Machine Washable Kitchen ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ysuR34BGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Give your loved ones and friends - or yourself - a practical gift that will bring a little Disney magic into their lives.  Disney luxury kitchen textiles offer a new level of quality, durability, and style. Our products are built for comfort and long-lasting performance. This adorable Disney Kitchen Towels Set was designed for you to cook/bake cleanly, so you don’t have to worry and can just enjoy cooking! Our Disney Princess Belle and the Beast kitchen towels and dishcloths sets are made of 100% cotton making them soft enough to absorb but durable enough to withstand repeated uses. Between washing tons of dishes, cooking delicious food, and cleaning up inevitable spills, you will certainly need to have these absorbent kitchen towels handy. Create your own Disney Princess Kitchen with this adorable dish towel set.  These conveniently sized dish rags measure 16 x 26 inches and are one of the most versatile and useful kitchen items you’ll own. Dish towels and dish cloths take a beating in the kitchen, so stains are inevitable. To care, wash separately before first use with like colors. Dark colors may bleed. Machine wash cold. Delicate cycle. Use mild detergent. Do not bleach. Line dry or lay flat to dry. Cool iron if needed. This Disney Textiles Collection offers an array of choices that make the perfect gift for Disney lovers, the men and women in your life than enjoy cooking and baking at home, or to commemorate the special day for the newlywed. Put a smile on the face of everyone who receives one. No matter the occasion; the perfect Mr and Mrs gifts, honeymoon gifts, bridal shower gifts, bridesmaid gifts, gifts for bride, his and hers, engagement gifts, anniversary gifts for couple, newlywed gifts, or \"just because\" present for wife. We hope you enjoy this quality product as we strive to bring you what you need to get the job done! Enjoy!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ysuR34BGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Best Brands","source_asin":"B09N9S24WL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-894931","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09N9S24WL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09N9S24WL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
