window.products.push({"id":894954,"name":"Bestonville Lingerie Bag Set - 5 Wash Bags - Heavy Duty Mesh Laundry Sacks for Big Clothes or Extra Large Garment Washing - 2 Zipper Colors for Easy D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YhV7I4BDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WASH LARGE KNITS, FABRICS AND CURTAINS AT HOME USING THE LARGEST AND MOST DURABLE MESH LAUNDRY BAGS WORLDWIDE. If you're tired of Repetitive Bending for Your Laundry, these bags will help Relieve Your Back. Whether you wash at home or use public laundromat, our Stylish French Vintage Design Lingerie Wash Bags will save you a lot of hassle with handling your laundry. Extend your garment life by preserving your clothing quality. 1) Best Travel Laundry Bag Organizers These tough no-tangle lingerie bags can be easily used as an extra protective layer in any storage space including knapsacks, sport and gym bags. 2) Our Unique Premium Quality 24\"x 24\" Jumbo Size Laundry Wash Bag Use this giant black bag to bulk wash anything you can imagine including stuffed animals. 3) Extremely tear resistant, elastic and washable laundry sorters Our strong yet fine mesh with robust construction makes it possible to wash any material and replaces other types of storage bags. High endurance mesh enables you to wash anything - from undergarment, intimates, stockings, t-shirts, shirts to blouses and hosiery. 4) Use them for other purposes. Our customers found new smart ways to use them. As reusable produce mesh bags to carry grocery fruit and vegetables or to store herbs. Perfect storage bags for kitchen bathroom or bedroom or for laundry accessories. Bleach or rinse them with any laundry detergent softener or whitener. Perfect replacement for commercial and industrial pop up mesh laundry bags with holder or stand including compartment hampers with safety hooks and hang snap pins or loops inside. These prime mesh laundry pouch bags with id labels protect red green grey navy blue or pink colored items and infant cloth diapers. Better than round mesh laundry bra bags. An essential organization laundry bag protector. A laundry care guard where your items are safer and cleaner, even when traveling","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YhV7I4BDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bestonville","source_asin":"B00X9KQPWU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-894954","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00X9KQPWU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00X9KQPWU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
