window.products.push({"id":894977,"name":"Stainless Steel Potato Ricer - Manual Masher for Potatoes, Fruits, Vegetables, Yams, Squash, Baby Food and More - Makes Light and Fluffy Mashed Potato","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MFFenwZXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Making restaurant quality meals in the comfort of your own home has never been easier with . Our potato ricer is the best device to have in your kitchen so you can create top-tier dishes with absolute ease! get your potato or any vegetable you want to mash up - squash, turnips, beets, carrots – pretty much anything you want! Press down the handles, and voila! PRODUCT FEATURES Stainless Steel Potato Ricer Ergonomic Comfort Handle Easy Manual Mechanism Works with Many Root Vegetables Great for Making Gnocchi, Baby Food, and Other Delectable Dishes Dishwasher Safe Great for mashed potatoes or for making your own baby food, it's made of stainless steel to withstand repeated use. Simply place this ricer over any bowl or pot, squeeze the gadget's handles, and mashed fruits and vegetables, especially potatoes, ooze right through. A nonslip knob helps hold it in place, and its soft handles have a comfortable grip. The Good Grips line features durable, nonslip, flexible handles on every product. Ergonomically designed to fit the palm comfortably, the pressure-absorbing, processed rubber handle puts less tension on the hands, while still providing an outstanding grip. Made from the same material as dishwasher gaskets, the handles are slip-proof, wet or dry, as well as dishwasher-safe. EASY MAINTENANCE Our tool is so easy to use that it's just as easy to keep in tip top shape! Unlike larger mashers and ricers that take a lot of effort just to clean with various nooks and crannies that seem impossible to completely get grime out, our ricer is a breeze to maintain! Every part is dishwasher safe and because the discs are removable, you are guaranteed everything is will be spotless and safe!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MFFenwZXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nonb","source_asin":"B089R9MTS7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-894977","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089R9MTS7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089R9MTS7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
